Package: methylflow
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible DNA Methylation Pipeline from Raw Data to Biological Interpretation
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("methylflow", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "methylflow@example.org")
Description: Ingests Illumina methylation array data (IDAT files, methylated/unmethylated
    intensity matrices with detection p-values, or beta matrices; 450K, EPIC, EPICv2) or
    bisulfite sequencing data (Bismark coverage files), runs sample and probe quality control,
    normalisation and covariate estimation (cell composition, sex, smoking), and produces a
    standardised dataset. Downstream functions test differential methylation (positions,
    regions, variance), benchmark epigenetic clocks, map results to genes, pathways and
    regulatory elements, write an HTML report and serve results in a Shiny app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/OWNER/methylflow
BugReports: https://github.com/OWNER/methylflow/issues
